{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:05 2026-10-17 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:10 2026-10-17 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:10 2026-10-17 HKT</p><img alt=\"蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6b7e361fc815c449c60efa4928341db7/2026-10/2026-10-17_01_00_13.png\"/><p>一股清勁至強風程度的偏東氣流正影響廣東沿岸。</p><p>本港地區今日大致多雲，日間部分時間有陽光，最高氣溫約30度。晚上有一兩陣微雨。吹和緩至清勁東風，初時離岸及高地間中吹強風。</p><img alt=\"日間部分時間有陽光，最高氣溫約30度。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0e3af4d8541edb6642f30db28ad6e66b/2026-10/12_3.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/45168aaf75b799a6490cbe121da953e5/2026-10/2026-10-17_01_01_08.png\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8a8d54d4f2b5cd5559e4582417376298/2026-10/2026-10-17_01_01_16.png\"/><img alt=\"日間部分時間有陽光，最高氣溫約30度。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/38ce4d588b3b90ab26012f736d4b1775/2026-10/13_3.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"日間部分時間有陽光，最高氣溫約30度。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6e5c4e97ca93663c9e87290805438c7c/2026-10/11_6.jpeg\"/><p>展望重陽節早上大致多雲，有一兩陣微雨，稍後至下週初漸轉天晴乾燥。下週中期日間炎熱。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T01:59:31.799074+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T00:05:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T03:57:46.238235+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T01:57:40.190474+00:00","content_hash":"9b5724fe179e7af5db95823fec394e108b90a115659ba45b15de0047b88043ef","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}